    "The first field-cohort environment collector accidentally substituted its directory name into the adapter filename. It was corrected while that same browser was still live; both final cohorts have current sandbox and binary receipts.",
    "Unmatched keys retain their engine handling. Native menu queries use the current native disabled-item consumption rule and do not supply a copied shortcut or renderer key-binding table."
